[14297] [2026-01-17 11:33:44] [INFO] [ENGINE]  <--------- ENGINE SEND: COMATE_AGENT_UPDATE_MESSAGE {"data":{"type":"partial-message-data","conversationInfo":{"id":"977ec667-0cb2-40af-8a72-830f099162d2","status":"Completed","type":"E2EBotConversation","utime":1768620824870,"ctime":1768530336987},"messages":[{"id":"85709844-58da-48fc-8391-12d9a5ec3d75","discard":false,"userMessageId":"15331005","reportedId":"5b9d315c-f7d5-4a73-8fa6-680ce7f98df6","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Zulu"},"role":"assistant","status":"success","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":96.63,"contextUsed":90192,"contextLimit":93333,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"b5724b5c-0116-48fb-9ebf-5d81478f1f55","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"让我先查看这个新线程池工具类的实现：\n\n","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696b02e8ea76f323cb8bcb5c"},{"id":"8da472fe-b8b3-4066-b67c-100564b91d9b","type":"TOOL_CALL","status":"success","toolName":"extract_content_blocks","discard":false,"composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"workflowStatus":"success","displayParams":{"firstFilePath":"tms-core/src/main/java/com/baidu/p2p/core/utils/NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil.java"},"displayResult":{"fileBlocks":[{"path":"tms-core/src/main/java/com/baidu/p2p/core/utils/NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil.java","startLine":1,"endLine":660}]},"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696b02e8ea76f323cb8bcb5c"},{"id":"c58be0c3-746f-4959-b390-dcc7869a53bd","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"## 🎯 **NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil 针对旧框架痛点的系统性解决方案**\n\n### **📋 旧框架痛点 vs 新框架解决方案对照表**\n\n| 旧框架痛点 | 新框架解决方案 | 技术实现 |\n|-----------|----------------|----------|\n| **1. 静态单例设计僵化** | **动态管理 + 健康检查** | 自动检测线程池状态，异常时自动重建 |\n| **2. 硬编码参数** | **配置化 + 参数校验** | 合理的默认值 + 创建时参数验证 |\n| **3. 配置与使用耦合** | **统一接口封装** | 包装器模式强制使用标准化提交方式 |\n| **4. 队列容量过大风险** | **智能监控预警** | 80%队列使用率预警，避免内存溢出 |\n| **5. 线程数固定** | **弹性线程池 + 动态调整** | 核心/最大线程分离，支持运行时调整 |\n| **6. 拒绝策略不当** | **增强型日志拒绝策略** | 带任务名称的智能拒绝处理 |\n| **7. 监控与统计缺失** | **全方位状态监控** | 详细的状态打印和队列使用率监控 |\n| **8. 生命周期管理不足** | **优雅关闭机制** | 超时控制 + 剩余任务处理 |\n| **9. 线程命名不规范** | **命名线程工厂** | 可配置的线程名前缀和优先级 |\n\n### **🔧 核心技术改进亮点**\n\n#### **1. 全链路异常处理**\n```java\n// 捕获所有Throwable（包括Error），防止线程池崩溃\ntry {\n    return wrapTaskWithLog(task, taskName).call();\n} catch (Throwable t) {\n    log.error(\"Task [{}] execution failed\", taskName, t);\n    throw t;\n}\n```\n\n#### **2. MDC上下文传递**\n```java\n// 解决异步任务日志链路追踪问题\nString originalTaskName = MDC.get(MDC_TASK_NAME_KEY);\ntry {\n    MDC.put(MDC_TASK_NAME_KEY, taskName);  // 注入任务名\n    // 执行任务...\n} finally {\n    // 恢复原始上下文\n}\n```\n\n#### **3. 包装器模式强制规范**\n```java\n// 包装ExecutorService，确保统一的任务提交逻辑\npublic class WrappedExecutorService implements ExecutorService {\n    @Override\n    public void execute(Runnable command) {\n        NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil.execute(this, command, \n            \"auto-execute-\" + TASK_ID_GENERATOR.incrementAndGet());\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### **4. 智能状态监控**\n```java\n// 队列饱和预警机制\ndouble queueUsage = (double) queueSize / queueCapacity;\nif (queueUsage > QUEUE_WARN_THRESHOLD) {  // 80%阈值\n    log.warn(\"ThreadPool [{}] queue is nearly full. Usage: {:.2f}%\", \n             poolName, queueUsage * 100);\n}\n```\n\n### **⚡ 性能与可靠性提升**\n\n#### **1. 优雅关闭机制**\n```java\n// 分阶段关闭：先优雅关闭，超时后强制关闭\ntargetExecutor.shutdown();\nif (!targetExecutor.awaitTermination(timeout, unit)) {\n    List<Runnable> remainingTasks = targetExecutor.shutdownNow();\n    log.info(\"Remaining unexecuted tasks: {}\", remainingTasks.size());\n}\n```\n\n#### **2. 动态参数调整**\n```java\n// 运行时线程池参数调整\npublic static void setCorePoolSize(ThreadPoolExecutor executor, int corePoolSize) {\n    executor.setCorePoolSize(corePoolSize);\n    log.info(\"Thread pool core size adjusted to: {}\", corePoolSize);\n}\n```\n\n#### **3. 批量任务支持**\n```java\n// 原生批量方法也支持MDC注入\npublic <T> List<Future<T>> invokeAll(Collection<? extends Callable<T>> tasks) {\n    List<Callable<T>> wrappedTasks = tasks.stream()\n        .map(task -> wrapCallable(task, \"batch-task-\" + TASK_ID_GENERATOR.incrementAndGet()))\n        .collect(Collectors.toList());\n    return target.invokeAll(wrappedTasks);\n}\n```\n\n### **🛡️ 安全与稳定性保障**\n\n#### **1. 参数校验**\n```java\n// 创建时的严格参数校验\nif (corePoolSize < 0 || maxPoolSize <= 0 || maxPoolSize < corePoolSize || queue == null) {\n    throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Invalid thread pool parameters\");\n}\n```\n\n#### **2. 异常隔离**\n```java\n// Error级异常单独处理，避免线程池崩溃\nif (t instanceof Error) {\n    log.error(\"Task [{}] encountered critical error, thread may be terminated\", taskName);\n}\n```\n\n#### **3. 资源管理**\n```java\n// JVM关闭钩子确保资源释放\nRuntime.getRuntime().addShutdownHook(new Thread(() -> {\n    shutdownAndAwaitTermination(wrappedDefaultExecutor, 30, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n}));\n```\n\n### **📊 使用体验改进**\n\n#### **1. 简化的API设计**\n```java\n// 多种便捷的提交方式\nsubmit(task, \"自定义任务名\");                    // 自定义命名\nsubmitWithTimeout(task, \"任务名\", 30, SECONDS); // 带超时控制\nexecute(runnable, \"异步任务\");                  // Runnable简化版\n```\n\n#### **2. 丰富的监控信息**\n```java\n// 详细的线程池状态输出\nThreadPool [DefaultThreadPool] Status: \nCore=10, Pool=15, Active=8, Largest=20, \nTaskCount=1500, Completed=1492, \nQueueSize=80/1000, QueueUsage=8.0%, \nShutdown=false, Terminating=false, Terminated=false\n```\n\n### **🎯 总结**\n\n**NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil 从根本上解决了旧框架的核心痛点**：\n\n- ✅ **从僵化到灵活**：支持动态配置和运行时调整\n- ✅ **从监控缺失到全方位监控**：内置状态监控和预警机制  \n- ✅ **从风险隐藏到风险暴露**：完善的异常处理和日志追踪\n- ✅ **从使用混乱到规范统一**：包装器模式强制最佳实践\n- ✅ **从资源泄漏到资源安全**：优雅的生命周期管理\n\n这是一个**企业级、生产就绪**的线程池解决方案，为TMS系统提供了**高可靠、可监控、易维护**的异步任务处理能力。","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696b02f0ea76f323cb8bcb63"}]}]}}
