[14217] [2026-01-19 19:04:35] [INFO] [ENGINE]  <--------- ENGINE SEND: COMATE_AGENT_UPDATE_MESSAGE {"data":{"type":"partial-message-data","conversationInfo":{"id":"097eafbf-0204-4fad-9d33-e179d760b89b","status":"Failed","type":"E2EBotConversation","utime":1768820675364,"ctime":1768813358070},"messages":[{"id":"8fc0a4cc-0950-410f-aa18-022d2b88a64c","discard":false,"userMessageId":"15671008","reportedId":"5119284d-688f-469f-800a-4bfe6c3e42ed","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Zulu"},"role":"assistant","status":"failed","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":91.36,"contextUsed":85269,"contextLimit":93333,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"3c6ff34e-0352-4177-85b4-8e37e429a4d7","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"我看到问题是Controller方法参数的问题。在前端Web Controller中，当方法参数中有`HttpServletRequest`和`HttpServletResponse`时，Spring会自动注入这些对象，但是`PayChecksQO`对象需要被标记为`@RequestBody`来从请求体中获取数据。然而，当包含文件下载功能时，直接返回ResponseMessage会与文件下载流冲突。\n\n让我检查项目中其他类似导出功能的实现方式，比如PayReviewController是怎么处理的：\n\n","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696e0f8aea76f323cb8f5b5b"},{"id":"7a85f33f-d20c-480f-8380-f180797e171f","type":"TOOL_CALL","status":"success","toolName":"extract_content_blocks","discard":false,"composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"workflowStatus":"success","displayParams":{"firstFilePath":"pmc-basic-web/src/main/java/com/baidu/pmc/web/controller/PayReviewController.java"},"displayResult":{"fileBlocks":[{"path":"pmc-basic-web/src/main/java/com/baidu/pmc/web/controller/PayReviewController.java","startLine":310,"endLine":325}]},"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696e0f8aea76f323cb8f5b5b"},{"id":"7696a4c0-ab45-439a-9e43-37556d5161f2","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"我发现问题了！在PayReviewController中，`PayChecksQO`参数没有加`@RequestBody`注解，但是其他功能类似的参数都有加。让我检查其他导出方法是否加了`@RequestBody`：\n\n","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessage