sing `python3` and the appropriate file paths, aiming to ensure their continuous operation. The key goal is to get the `auto_trader.py` and `app.py` running and to reset the data in the `quant_trading/data/` directory. I've also incorporated error redirection for logs.\n\n\n**Implementing the Final Command**\n\nI'm now building the final command, streamlining the process into a single line. This involves safely killing the existing processes using `pkill`, removing all data files in the `quant_trading/data/` directory, and launching both the auto-trader and the Streamlit web app in the background. I'm using `/dev/null` for standard output and standard error redirection to avoid overwhelming the output. I'm confident in the approach and preparing to execute it.\n\n\n**Compiling the Execution Plan**\n\nI've finalized the execution plan, ready to provide the complete command to the user. It entails terminating existing processes, clearing data files within the designated directory, and subsequently launching the auto-trader and the Streamlit web application in the background to ensure continuous operation, addressing any potential issues with file pathing and process management. I'm focusing on minimizing clutter by redirecting both standard output and standard error to `/dev/null` to keep the user interface streamlined.\n\n\n","status":"success","discard":false,"startTime":1768894121965,"lastModifiedTime":1768894134962,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696f2e8836e45f48e1bd943c"},{"id":"1e010d32-d651-4ef4-a0f2-e44f387b8eae","type":"TEXT","status":"success","content":"没问题，我来执行“清零重启”操作：停止旧进程、清空历史数据、并重新启动后台机器人和前台页面。\n\n","composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"discard":false,"isErrorMessage":false,"parentMessageId":"","retryMessageId":"696f2e8836e45f48e1bd943c"},{"id":"f5607e5f-cb97-4106-92a3-6891c5784788","type":"TOOL_CALL","status":"success","toolName":"run_command","discard":false,"composer":{"markdown":"","tasks":[]},"workflowStatus":"success","displayParams":{"pa