[14217] [2026-01-20 20:30:37] [INFO] [ENGINE]  ---------> ENGINE REC: VIRTUAL_EDITOR_EVENT {"uuid":"c681ded9-7986-49c2-90f1-6d4256b0a822","existed":true,"content":"import java.io.UnsupportedEncodingException;\n\npublic class test_encoding {\n    /**\n     * 模拟浏览器验证CSV编码（用于测试）\n     */\n    public static String simulateBrowserEncodingCheck() {\n        // 测试中文字符样本\n        String testChinese = \"测试中文付款主体银行账户收款人信息\";\n\n        try {\n            // 模拟GB2312编码和解码过程\n            byte[] gb2312Bytes = testChinese.getBytes(\"GB2312\");\n            String decoded = new String(gb2312Bytes, \"GB2312\");\n\n            // 检查是否能正确还原中文\n            boolean encodingCorrect = testChinese.equals(decoded);\n\n            // 同时测试UTF-8对比\n            byte[] utf8Bytes = testChinese.getBytes(\"UTF-8\");\n            String utf8Decoded = new String(utf8Bytes, \"UTF-8\");\n\n            return String.format(\"CSV编码验证结果:\\n\\n\" +\n                               \"=== GB2312 编码测试 ===\\n\" +\n                               \"原始中文: %s\\n\" +\n                               \"GB2312编码后字节数: %d\\n\" +\n                               \"GB2312解码后: %s\\n\" +\n                               \"GB2312编码一致性: %s\\n\\n\" +\n                               \"=== UTF-8 编码对比 ===\\n\" +\n                               \"UTF-8编码后字节数: %d\\n\" +\n                               \"UTF-8解码后: %s\\n\" +\n                               \"UTF-8编码一致性: %s\\n\\n\" +\n                               \"=== 浏览器兼容性分析 ===\\n\" +\n                               \"GB2312字节数比UTF-8少: %d字节\\n\" +\n                               \"GB2312优点: 字节数更少，加载更快\\n\" +\n                               \"建议: 如果GB2312编码正确，浏览器和Excel都能正确显示中文\",\n                               testChinese, gb2312Bytes.length, decoded,\n                               encodingCorrect ? \"✅ 正确\" : \"❌ 错误\",\n                               utf8Bytes.length, utf8Decoded,\n                               testChinese.equals(utf8Decoded) ? \"✅ 正确\" : \"❌ 错误\",\n                               utf8Bytes.length - gb2312Bytes.length);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            return \"编码验证异常: \" + e.getMessage();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(simulateBrowserEncodingCheck());\n    }\n}","completed":false,"isEnd":false,"failed":false}
