 \" (乱码)\" : \" (正确)\"));\n            \n            // 模拟浏览器解码过程\n            System.out.println(\"\\n=== 浏览器解码模拟 ===\");\n            String browserDecoded = new String(correctEncoding.getBytes(StandardCharsets.ISO_8859_1), \"UTF-8\");\n            System.out.println(\"浏览器解码后显示: \" + browserDecoded);\n            \n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        }\n    }\n}","stream":true,"source":"E2EBotConversation","acceptable":true,"action":"edit","openFileDiff":false,"conversationId":"097eafbf-0204-4fad-9d33-e179d760b89b","elementId":"837e149b-8231-41ab-a36a-5eb2c56035c7","inlineView":true,"uuid":"1953f62b-6365-41eb-a05f-420f8e7f1215"}}
